{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100323","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100323/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100323/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100323/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100323","id":2736282079,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6FCfQc","number":100323,"title":"Rename `List` -> `LinkedList`, with a `List` alias pointing to `LinkedList`.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2304948121,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzA0OTQ4MTIx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:codestyle","name":"topic:codestyle","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":8,"created_at":"2024-12-12T15:51:23Z","updated_at":"2025-01-04T12:52:33Z","closed_at":"2025-01-04T09:48:46Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100323","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100323","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100323.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100323.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"The reason is that `List` [is ambiguous](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_(abstract_data_type)). In most languages, it refers to sequences of undefined backing — either as an abstract class, like `Java`, or as a concrete type with encapsulated backing, like `Python` or `C#` (although all major implementations use array backings). The only languages where `List` is inherently linked are functional languages, which don't support the concept of contiguous arrays (although interestingly, some implementations _still_ optimize by using array backings where possible).\r\n\r\nIn instances where a `linked list` is needed, it would be advisable to use `LinkedList` explicitly.\r\nIn instances where the backing is unimportant, or not known which performs best, continuing to use `List` would be OK. Maintainers should be able to decide which is the most efficient backing type for these instances. Classes like `Vector`, `LocalVector` and others are already fairly close in interface to `List` / `LinkedList`, so it is realistic that this could be done _at some point_ if wanted.\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100323/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100323/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}